INFO 2026-04-26 08:56:50,059 chat_sync.sync [request_id=4D71C94B-8642-440C-B866-CF5817C9D071] chat push payload request_id=4D71C94B-8642-440C-B866-CF5817C9D071 user_id=6 content_type=application/json body={"messages":[{"thread_id":"2f2f5322-7b2b-4918-a6a4-5d94c1d64ed0","role":"assistant","kind":"text","content":"我已为你生成一周减肥待确认任务卡片，你可以点击下方卡片确认内容是否符合需求，确认后会自动同步到你的任务列表中：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_cards\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"一周减肥计划\",\n      \"sub_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"title\": \"每日运动达标\",\n          \"description\": \"每日累计步数≥7000步，或完成30分钟中等强度运动（慢跑/骑行/健身操等）\",\n          \"frequency\": \"每天\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"饮食热量控制\",\n          \"description\": \"每日总摄入热量控制在基础代谢*1.1范围内，晚餐减少精制碳水摄入，保证每日蛋白质≥1g/每公斤体重\",\n          \"frequency\": \"每天\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"作息规律\",\n          \"description\": \"每日睡眠时间≥7小时，避免熬夜（23点前入睡）\",\n          \"frequency\": \"每天\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"周体重监测\",\n          \"description\": \"固定每周一早上空腹称重并记录，目标周减重0.5~1kg\",\n          \"frequency\": \"每周一\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n如果需要调整运动强度、饮食要求或增加具体任务项，可以随时告诉我修改。","model_name":"doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215","client_message_id":"e1f9e373-c2c9-4360-883e-f42dc9ed7feb","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-04-26 08:56:38.656000+00:00","server_updated_at":"2026-04-26 08:56:38.821000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":4096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","thread_system_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","attachments":[{"text":"generate_task, query_tasks_by_member","id":"2FC217DF-5DCC-4E43-8441-FA42BF517D12","type":"toolName"},{"text":"[1] query_tasks_by_member\n{\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-26T08:56:18.257Z\",\"tasks\":[],\"ok\":true,\"member_id\":28,\"total\":0}\n\n[2] generate_task\n已根据描述生成 1 条待确认任